&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Quantitative Research Intern at Schonfeld Strategic Advisors, you&#39;ll work at the intersection of data science, financial markets and systematic trading, solving real-world problems that drive live investment strategies. This internship offers hands-on experience in quantitative research, supported by structured onboarding, a meaningful project of your own, and direct mentorship from senior researchers and portfolio managers. The internship will be 3-6 months, including the summer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[7304],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
