&lt;li&gt;3+ years at a sell-side firm in a trading or quantitative research role, or as a quant at a buy-side credit or mortgage-focused fund.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree or higher in computer science, economics, engineering, mathematics, physics, or statistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of a programming language such as Python, C++, or SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
