&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Final presentations must be submitted by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;November 9, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
