&lt;li&gt;Teams that do not follow the registration requirements may be disqualified.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final Round Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
