&lt;p&gt;The Performance Marketing team’s mission is to drive efficient, data-driven customer acquisition and growth for Robinhood by optimizing paid marketing investment across performance marketing channels like Google and Meta.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Performance marketing intern, you will own performance marketing campaigns across Google and paid social, and are responsible for the full-funnel performance of your campaigns.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Menlo Park, CA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
