&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimize day-to-day performance marketing campaigns across Google Ads and paid social platforms (Meta, TikTok, etc.), monitoring spend, pacing, and performance against targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign data to identify trends, surface actionable insights, and recommend optimizations to improve CAC, ROAS, and other key performance metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain performance dashboards/reports to track campaign results and communicate findings to the broader marketing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct A/B tests on ad creative, targeting, and bidding strategies, and translate results into optimization recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with growth and analytics teams to ensure budget allocation and channel strategy are grounded in data, not assumptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
