&lt;li&gt;Research scientist mindset: deep thinker, creative, strong work ethic, persevering, smart &amp;amp; a self-starter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail oriented and capable of multitasking and delivering in fast-paced work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
